<title>HONG KONG: Bk of E.Asia appoints David Li chairman.</title>
<headline>Bk of E.Asia appoints David Li chairman.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of East Asia Ltd said on Tuesday it has appointed David Li as chairman of the bank, replacing Li Fook Wo who decided to step down due to advanced age. David Li had been deputy chairman.</p>
</text>
